# Terrain and placement share one grid, so the board is what it looks like.
#   .  open        #  wall        O  pit        ^  spikes      H  high ground
#   A  Player A deploy slot       B  Player B deploy slot
#   any other letter = an enemy declared by a 'spawn' line below

id: ec-05-perch-war
number: 305
name: Perch War
pool: Ordinary
description: Two Lobbers make the floor expensive and two ledges make the Archer lethal, but a Grappler picks whoever is standing on high ground first. Somebody else has to want the view.
design: Enemy composition 5 — the ledge your Archer wants is the tile the Grappler hunts.

spawn l = Lobber
spawn g = Grappler
spawn h = Husk

roster a: Vanguard, Archer
roster b: Threadcaster, Wardbearer

board:
  ..l.l..
  ...g...
  ......B
  .H...HB
  ......B
  A.^.^..
  AA..h..
